{"title":"2004 Indonesia MO Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Day_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Day_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day 2</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Problem_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Problem_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 8</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Day_1\">Day 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Day 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>How many odd and even divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07f49d7ea42b17825ed4add0802e1ead746114a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^6 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"15\" /> are there?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>A trough, if filled with cold water tap, will be full in 14 minutes. To empty the full trough with opening the hole on the base of the trough, the water will be all out in 21 minutes. If the cold water tap and the hot water tap are opened simultaneously with the opening of the hole, the trough will be full in 12.6 minutes. Then, how long does it take to full the trough when only the hot water tap is opened and the hole is closed?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>In how many ways can we change the sign <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/8/278afa87a7dfa8e2b3f40e608884a690fb1325f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ast$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, such that the following equation is true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/d/22db81cccf46c5a20ab9b552f95dac9e0b2e38ef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 \\ast 2 \\ast 3 \\ast 4 \\ast 5 \\ast 6 \\ast 7 \\ast 8 \\ast 9 \\ast 10 = 29\\]\" width=\"294\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>There exists 4 circles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/6/bb60e0857a2c0a2c47acfbe81781032feb1f7150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is tangent to both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is tangent to both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is both tangent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is both tangent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Show that all these tangent points are located on a circle.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Day_2\">Day 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Day 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Given a system of equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/d/b9d92d1656c1799aea919feb1baf6b949b4219cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x_1 + 4x_2 + 9x_3 + 16x_4 + 25x_5 + 36x_6 + 49x_7 = 1\\\\4x_1 + 9x_2 + 16x_3 + 25x_4 + 36x_5 + 49x_6 + 64x_7 = 12\\\\9x_1 + 16x_2 + 25x_3 + 36x_4 + 49x_5 + 64x_6 + 81x_7 = 123\\end{array}\\right.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -27px\" width=\"451\" height=\"64\" />\n</p><p>Then determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/e/19e549e87b535086ffd082bb5cdf7fc45368a32e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = 16x_1 + 25x_2 + 36x_3 + 49x_4 + 64x_5 + 81x_6 + 100x_7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"430\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>A quadratic equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0f7e139ac19956348be49ad256dd119a0f64f59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + ax + b + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" /> with integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> has roots which are positive integers. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d3200f508f2bf0ee872dcc13ec904170623dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" /> is not a prime.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_7\">Problem 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Prove that in a triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> as the right angle, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> denote the side in front of angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> denote the side in front of angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> denote the side in front of angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, the diameter of the incircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> equals to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/1/bf14b82893f9e6802fe2870f4b640d6bcda41868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b - c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_8\">Problem 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>A floor with an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/c/bcce78db89b0b83cf88d2812da6d3d4d84cc9476.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\text{ m}^2$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> will be covered by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> rugs with various shapes, each having an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/a/d5a4d00251092ed3a1756a1f9db03dc5c05bb388.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\text{ m}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />.  Show that there exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> overlapping rugs with the overlapped area at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/6/476d47d82d0b04a28c9d66544fa4fce2f72a32b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/5 \\text{ m}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO\">2004 Indonesia MO</a></b> (<b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2003 Indonesia MO\">2003 Indonesia MO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Indonesia_MO\" title=\"2005 Indonesia MO\">2005 Indonesia MO</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Indonesia MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018050446\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 259/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 986/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 82/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7050/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.483      1 Template:Indonesia_MO_box\n100.00%    8.483      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16551:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018050446 and revision id 96544. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}